 FIIs net sell Rs 5,285 crore, DIIs net buy Rs 3,319 crore on Oct 15 
 FIIs sold Rs 5,285.37 crore in 15th straight selling session.
 Sensex rose 1,533.72 points and Nifty gained 374.65 points.
